* Diode model library for KiCad/ngspice
* 1N5817, 1N5818, 1N5819 and PDZ12B are historical imported models.
* Their exact upstream source is not recorded and must be established before
* public redistribution. Each model is used by a matching symbol.
.MODEL 1N5817 D( IS=870u RS=81.3m BV=20.0 IBV=1.00m CJO=203p  M=0.333 N=1.81 TT=4.32u )
.MODEL 1N5818 D( IS=263u RS=73.1m BV=30.0 IBV=1.00m CJO=203p  M=0.333 N=1.90 TT=4.32u )
.MODEL 1N5819 D( IS=390n RS=0.115 BV=40.0 IBV=1.00m CJO=203p  M=0.333 N=1.70 TT=4.32u )
.MODEL PDZ12B D( IS = 1.429E-014 N = 1.101 BV = 11.99 IBV = 0.005 RS = 0.3705 CJO = 4.928E-11 VJ = 0.575 M = 0.3292 )

* Datasheet source: https://www.vishay.com/docs/81857/1n4148.pdf
* Generic ngspice model calibrated to the typical forward characteristic.
* Rated limits represented by the model: 100 V repetitive peak reverse voltage
* and 4 pF maximum junction capacitance. Reverse recovery is approximated by
* transit time and is not guaranteed to match every manufacturer's process.
* Pin order: A K
.SUBCKT 1N4148 A K
DFAST A K D_1N4148
.MODEL D_1N4148 D (
+ IS=2.682n N=1.836 RS=0.5664 IKF=44.17m
+ CJO=4p VJ=0.5 M=0.3333 FC=0.5
+ BV=100 IBV=100u TT=4n EG=1.11 XTI=3 TNOM=25
+ )
.ENDS 1N4148

* Datasheet source: https://www.vishay.com/docs/85816/1n4728a.pdf
* Generic, DC-oriented ngspice model; no manufacturer SPICE model is bundled.
* Calibrated to Vz = 12.0 V at Izt = 21 mA and 25 C.
* Simulated dynamic resistance around Izt is approximately 8.1 ohm, below the
* data-sheet maximum of 9 ohm. CJO is a representative, non-guaranteed value.
* Pin order: A K
.SUBCKT 1N4742A a c
 DZEN a c 1N4742A_D
.MODEL 1N4742A_D D (
 + IS=10f N=1 RS=8
 + BV=11.832 IBV=21m NBV=0.1
 + CJO=100p VJ=0.7 M=0.33
 + )
.ENDS 1N4742A

* Generic indicator LED models for KiCad/ngspice
* Pin order for every subcircuit: A K
* Nominal calibration temperature: 25 C
*
* These are generic electrical models, not manufacturer-specific models.
* Light output, luminous intensity and wavelength are not modeled.

* Red indicator LED: Vf = 2.0 V at If = 20 mA
.subckt LED_RED A K
DLED A K LED_RED_D
.model LED_RED_D D (
+ IS=5.62097e-18 N=2 RS=8
+ BV=5 IBV=10u CJO=30p VJ=0.75 M=0.33 TT=50n
+ EG=1.8 XTI=3 TNOM=25
+ )
.ends LED_RED

* Traditional green indicator LED: Vf = 2.2 V at If = 20 mA
.subckt LED_GREEN A K
DLED A K LED_GREEN_D
.model LED_GREEN_D D (
+ IS=2.49765e-19 N=2 RS=10
+ BV=5 IBV=10u CJO=25p VJ=0.75 M=0.33 TT=50n
+ EG=2.2 XTI=3 TNOM=25
+ )
.ends LED_GREEN

* Blue indicator LED: Vf = 3.1 V at If = 20 mA
.subckt LED_BLUE A K
DLED A K LED_BLUE_D
.model LED_BLUE_D D (
+ IS=9.19237e-22 N=2.5 RS=12
+ BV=5 IBV=10u CJO=20p VJ=0.75 M=0.33 TT=50n
+ EG=2.8 XTI=3 TNOM=25
+ )
.ends LED_BLUE

* White indicator LED: Vf = 3.2 V at If = 20 mA
.subckt LED_WHITE A K
DLED A K LED_WHITE_D
.model LED_WHITE_D D (
+ IS=1.93770e-22 N=2.5 RS=12
+ BV=5 IBV=10u CJO=20p VJ=0.75 M=0.33 TT=50n
+ EG=2.8 XTI=3 TNOM=25
+ )
.ends LED_WHITE

* Vishay BZX55C calibrated-model library for KiCad/ngspice
* Pin order for every subcircuit: A K
* Manufacturer-provided variants retain the Vishay topology and curve shape.
* Their BEB offsets are shifted so terminal Vz equals the data-sheet nominal
* voltage at Izt and 25 C. BZX55C10 is a documented generic model because
* Vishay does not publish a SPICE model for that variant.

* Official source: https://www.vishay.com/docs/85282/bzx55c2v7.txt
* ngspice conversion: PSpice POLY(1) source replaced by equivalent B source;
* subcircuit renamed to the full Vishay part number; BEB offset calibrated at Izt.
********************************
* Copyright:                   *
* Vishay Intertechnology, Inc. *
********************************
* Technology:	DISCRETE DEVICE
* Device:	Zener Diode BZX 55C 2V7
* Type:	Typical (nom)
* Remarks:	Macro model
* Revision:
* Simulator:	PSPICE

.SUBCKT BZX55C2V7 a c

 DF a c BZX55C2V7_DFOR
 DR c a BZX55C2V7_DREV
 DB b a BZX55C2V7_DBRE
 BEB c b V=0.95447845+V(d)
 IB 0 d 1m
 RB 0 d 1k TC=-0.1m

.MODEL BZX55C2V7_DFOR D
 + IS =   12p  RS =    0  N  =  1.5  CJO= 300p
 + VJ = 500m  M  = 345m  FC = 700m  XTI=    3
 + EG =    1

.MODEL BZX55C2V7_DREV D
 + IS = 150f  N  =   10  XTI=    3  EG =1.186

.MODEL BZX55C2V7_DBRE D
 + IS =  12f  RS =   10  N  =    1  XTI=    0
 + EG =1.186

.ENDS BZX55C2V7

